  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAB/GEO-Strengthening national capacities for effective biodiversity conservation and Geoparks management in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This element will support development of national capacities of Egypt in the fields of biodiversity conservation and Geoparks management  through supporting national capacities to finalize the periodic reporting exercise on MAB sites in Egypt, preparation of a database of Geoparks (cataloguing, experts consultation processes and digital platform in place), updating of the tentative list of Geoparks, consultation to enlarge the tentative list of MAB, finalization of the methodology to assess the environmental services of MAB and Geoparks sites, support the involvement in international MAB meeting, and support reporting on perceptions of climate change and its impacts on the general public and targeted group of interest in Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
